msgid ""
"The **StrobeIT Pro** is the industrial-grade evolution of the StrobeIT, "
"designed by **TeraVolt Labs** for heavy-lift and long-range UAVs. It "
"features enhanced brightness, ruggedized mounting."
msgstr ""
"**StrobeIT Pro** 是 StrobeIT 的工业级进化版，由 **TeraVolt Labs** "
"为重载和远程无人机设计。它具有更高的亮度和加固的安装方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-StrobeIT-Pro.rst:13
